<title>USA: Lexmark to launch six-color printing.</title>
<headline>Lexmark to launch six-color printing.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lexmark International said Monday it planned to launch by year's end six-color printing to enable its inkjet printers to produce digitized images that are nearly as good as photographs developed the traditional way.</p>
<p>Lexmark said it would reveal more details about the printing later this fall.</p>
<p>It said it had formed an alliance with Polaroid Corp earlier this month to market and develop high-definition color image printers and consumables.</p>
</text>
